---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import mark from "../assets/brand/kns-mark.png";
---
<Base title="About the Studio" description="Kuro Neko Sama Studios is the one-person game and book studio of Ross Wilkinson in Las Vegas, maker of Heroes of Lumora and Aldenexia: Lightfall.">
  <div class="wrap page-hero about">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>One person, a lot of hats.</h1>
      <p>Kuro Neko Sama Studios is the home for Ross Wilkinson's games and books, in Las Vegas, Nevada.</p>
    </div>
    <Image src={mark} alt="Kuro Neko Sama Studios cat mark" width={260} />
  </div>
  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Ross designs and builds the games in Godot, writes the books, and makes music. By day he's a senior network architect and a PADI scuba instructor, which is where the first book, <a href="/books/"><em>Zen Divers</em></a>, came from.</p>
      <h2>A world started at fifteen</h2>
      <p>The world of Aldenexia began when Ross was about fifteen, sketched out between sessions of D&amp;D-inspired computer games like Pool of Radiance and the Ultima series. The goal back then was the same as it is now: to bring that world to life, so other people could walk around in it.</p>
      <p>Years later, EverQuest showed what that could feel like: a world so big and so alive that it pulled you in and didn't let go. That's the bar the studio's games are reaching for.</p>
      <p>Heroes of Lumora and Aldenexia: Lightfall are both steps toward it. Heroes of Lumora is the fast one: a fantasy bullet-hell set in the town of Lumora, which you can finish in an evening and replay for months. Aldenexia: Lightfall is the long one: a multiplayer RPG about exploring that world and living with your choices. They share a home, and some of the same people.</p>
      <p>The studio used to go by two names, Kuro Neko Sama Games and KNS Books. As of late 2026 they're one: Kuro Neko Sama Studios.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn primary" href="/games/">The games</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact/">Say hello</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about :global(img) { width: 160px; } }
</style>
